ong. Tried multiple times, still unable to reset pw via app. Then at last prompts me to update app version. Noticed that this happens every time there's a new release. Locks users out without prompting users to update app version. Damn frustrating! Not user friendly at all! After version upgrade, it tells me to contact customer service. I'm stuck overseas, how to call, especially when such a call takes min 30min?!!\",[1630993892,841000000],31,null,null,[\"113846680504441143002\",\"鹿麋\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKj0JxNQTpup25jiAGSSIPui73wLgsdjPW5UEpaw3J3TpynWw\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.12.0\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,1],[\"9f143355-e7ef-4d55-b4bf-558764f6950f\",[\"Seejan Store\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIjVRSK0Oq_fspiLIz4KS84X7kqKPszgeJ4IJk7q2oX50g8CTH\"]]],5,null,\"good\",[1630983239,304000000],0,null,null,[\"108348352362458424896\",\"Seejan Store\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIjVRSK0Oq_fspiLIz4KS84X7kqKPszgeJ4IJk7q2oX50g8CTH\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],null,null,[[[\"vaf_never_display_content_language\",[1]],[\"vaf_phase1_auto_investing\",[1]],[\"vaf_phase1_investing\",[1]]]],null,null,null,1],[\"405ded1d-60a9-46ee-8ceb-efcda3a1a5f8\",[\"Kingsley RBC\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLA07wd97uST7SCdpE3KXWjkr8RDbQLkSGL8544S9CJBHV9zw\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"使用經驗非常之差! 每每在街上想使用時, 總會遇著”更新才再使用...使用無線網絡避免數據費用云云”. 不如老實d同用家講:\\\"不更新便不可使用吧!\\\" 銀行負責人, 用家在街上如何忽然找個安全可靠的無線網絡呢? 用家的手機數據費用多數是自己付費的, 如何應付貴行的\\\"常常\\\"更新下載呀? 有冇考慮過用提示方式, 讓用家找個方便時間才更新呢? 安全性問題的話, 不如做好多d 才推更新啦, 減少騷擾用家好不好? 謝謝.\",[1630656831,692000000],0,null,null,[\"116070054259479281356\",\"Kingsley RBC\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLA07wd97uST7SCdpE3KXWjkr8RDbQLkSGL8544S9CJBHV9zw\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.11.0\",null,[[[\"vaf_never_display_ads_experience\",null,[1]],[\"vaf_never_display_ease_of_use\",null,[1]]]],null,[true,false],null,1],[\"7f31c5c8-8cc5-487d-96e9-eede31a376fa\",[\"Jpwarren Ycw\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwTA7n2O3_qoxABwXuyuDDPMlLEGN5uWKvVTOTJ2F1qapIyw\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"有些動作手機用不方便，想用電腦網上版也改成手機版，咁樣叫 adaptive design!!? 比如睇過去 trx 已無 date filter. 越改越差同個 branding 一樣\",[1630583239,966000000],0,null,null,[\"114604296076713144085\",\"Jpwarren Ycw\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwTA7n2O3_qoxABwXuyuDDPMlLEGN5uWKvVTOTJ2F1qapIyw\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.12.0\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"e4ed4c24-8ec2-43de-9791-d287d8735e2c\",[\"WALLACE LIN\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXV728u2hIQzVBWZ75FPjP2nieKlXZTAlEUz9o42H47ossh_-c\"]]],1,null,\"Bad with slow reaction after it changed to the new version this year!!!!\",[1630343974,264000000],3,null,null,[\"109098791450545077311\",\"WALLACE LIN\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXV728u2hIQzVBWZ75FPjP2nieKlXZTAlEUz9o42H47ossh_-c\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.12.0\",null,[[[\"vaf_phase1_fdic_insured\",[2]],[\"vaf_phase1_linking_bank_accounts\",[3]],[\"vaf_phase1_tax_preparation\",[2]]]],null,null,null